    <string name="setup_icons">Icons next to the clock</string>
    <string name="setup_icons_hint">One small icon per item with its value drawn in it, e.g. a download arrow and 12K. Needs no extra permission. Android decides the exact place: they appear on the left, next to the clock.</string>
    <string name="setup_overlay">Text strip in the status bar</string>
    <string name="setup_overlay_hint">One strip with all chosen items, after the clock or before the system icons. Needs the permission Display over other apps.</string>
    <string name="setup_overlay_perm">The strip needs the permission Display over other apps. Open settings, pick TaskBarStatsMobile and switch it on, then come back.</string>
